NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY REFERENCE CODE

A small part of this project's asset-hash-to-CDN-URL resolution technique
(see backend/main.py, functions get_hash_url / the "Faizdzn method" download
flow) was originally adapted from Faizdzn/rblxapi_backend
(https://github.com/Faizdzn/rblxapi_backend), an archived, unlicensed
reference implementation. That upstream repository does not carry an
explicit open-source license, so the MIT terms above apply only to the
original code written for 3DRBX-MT, not to that specific ported technique.
See CREDITS.md for details. If you are the author of that project and have
concerns about this usage, please open an issue and it will be addressed
promptly.
